        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Compliance with these laws in all jurisdictions where we operate, therefore, is a significant factor in the operation of our business and may result in capital expenditures as well as additional operating costs.",
        "start_character": 17417,
        "end_character": 17628
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our sustainability efforts are carried out in all of the regions where we operate, by multiple business teams into whose responsibilities sustainability concepts have been integrated.",
        "start_character": 41343,
        "end_character": 41526
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, various jurisdictions where we operate have passed laws to address climate change that have an impact on us and our work to reduce GHG emissions, as described above in “-Environmental and Other Regulations - Environmental and Climate Change Regulation.”",
        "start_character": 37390,
        "end_character": 37657
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Each region in which we operate exhibits different supply and demand characteristics.",
        "start_character": 1522,
        "end_character": 1607
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2024, we conducted a global employee engagement survey, which indicated that employee engagement levels are fairly high across all regions in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 11338,
        "end_character": 11500
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we spent approximately $5.4 million, and over the course of 2026 and 2027 we expect to spend $10 to $12 million, on capital projects in the aggregate for our mills in the three regions where we operate to control environmental releases into the air and water and to assure environmentally sound management and disposal of waste.",
        "start_character": 22200,
        "end_character": 22537
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we continue to emphasize the importance of employees’ physical and mental health and well‑being and provide opportunities and resources to support them, including our Employee Assistance Program and other benefit resources available in all regions where we operate.",
        "start_character": 7950,
        "end_character": 8228
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our talent strategy focuses on attracting and retaining the best employee talent from the diverse backgrounds of the communities where we operate.",
        "start_character": 8945,
        "end_character": 9091
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Since we introduced the program, we have consistently worked to increase safety through initiatives developed and implemented under the program.",
        "start_character": 6893,
        "end_character": 7037
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Sylvamo is subject to a wide range of general and industry-specific laws and regulations that are complex and changing in the regions, countries, states and other jurisdictions where we operate.",
        "start_character": 16093,
        "end_character": 16287
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001856485-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001856485-26-000008-025ff239fdfd1b26",
        "accession_number": "0001856485-26-000008",
